================================================================================

This module is an original Devotica Labs implementation, not derived from
a specific third-party module. It wraps AWS Security Hub account
enrollment, standards subscriptions, cross-region finding aggregation,
and EventBridge-based findings notifications, following the same
fintech-safe defaults and mandatory-tagging conventions established
across this catalog (see terraform-aws-vpc, terraform-aws-sqs).

